Source: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Mischa <mischa.siekmann@futureproofhomes.net>
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Build-Depends:
  debhelper-compat (= 13),
  dh-python,
  device-tree-compiler,
Homepage: https://github.com/futureproofhomes/Satellite1-RPi

Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: 
  ${misc:Depends},
  @KERNEL_PKG@,
  python3-venv, 
  python3-pip, 
  flashrom,
  libasound2-plugins
Recommends:
  alsa-utils,
  lm-sensors  
Description: Satellite1 I2S overlay, ALSA config, and boot-time I²C init
 Installs Satellite1 device-tree overlay, ALSA PCM config, and a systemd
 oneshot service that initializes the IO expander and DAC at boot.


